<decision #migrate-cell-data-graph-foundations.consumer-read {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>How should stage consumers read declared dependencies under 1.0.1?</?>
  <answer { }(
    <raw-answer ?>Through the owning DataGraph.</?>
    <decision-text ?>Replace callback ctx.get(ref) reads with supported graph reads over the same module refs.</?>
    <rationale ?>The target consumer callback is an effect trigger, not an ambient graph reader.</?>
    <evidence ?>G5 verification and upstream unified graph tests.</?>
  )>
)>
